# Proof frames and caches for the HyperFrames projects in this directory.
#
# Snapshots are regenerated on every `hyperframes snapshot` run and are
# overwritten constantly during authoring, so tracking them means a few hundred
# KB of churn per iteration for images that say nothing the source doesn't.
# Renders ARE tracked: the MP4 is the deliverable.
snapshots/
.hyperframes/
.thumbnails/
node_modules/
